cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository is a fork of CLUMPY that makes it run on a current Python
  toolchain; it serves as the reference implementation that the allocators of
  evoland.plus are compared against. Cite the methods by the references below,
  and name the commit of this repository when referring to the code that was run.
title: "clumpy: reference implementation for the allocators of evoland.plus (fork of CLUMPY)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mazy
    given-names: François-Rémi
  - family-names: Longaretti
    given-names: Pierre-Yves
repository-code: "https://github.com/mmyrte/clumpy"
url: "https://gitlab.inria.fr/fmazy/clumpy"
